### ============================================================
### Advanced Filter API - HTTP Client Test Workspace
### ============================================================
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### ============================================================
### 1. BASELINE QUERIES - Paginated Results
### ============================================================

### Fetch all articles (default pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles
Accept: application/json

### Fetch articles with custom pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?per_page=5
Accept: application/json

### Fetch page 2 of articles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?per_page=10
Accept: application/json

### Fetch all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/categories
Accept: application/json

### Fetch categories with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/categories?per_page=10
Accept: application/json

### Fetch all tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/tags
Accept: application/json

### Fetch tags with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/tags?per_page=25
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================
### 2. ADVANCED DIRECT FIELD FILTERING
### ============================================================

### Filter articles by exact status (published)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[status][eq]=published
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by status (draft)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[status][eq]=draft
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by LIKE title
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[title][like]=laravel
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by view count > 1000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[view_count][gt]=1000
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by view count between 500 and 5000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[view_count][gte]=500&filter[view_count][lte]=5000
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by view count <= 100
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[view_count][lte]=100
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles where status is empty (null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[status][empty]=true
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles where status is filled (not null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[status][filled]=true
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by multiple statuses (in)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[status][in]=published,draft
Accept: application/json

### Full-text global search on articles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?search=laravel
Accept: application/json

### Full-text global search for a common term
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?search=testing
Accept: application/json

### Sort articles by view count descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?sort=-view_count
Accept: application/json

### Sort articles by title ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?sort=title
Accept: application/json

### Sort articles by created_at descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?sort=-created_at
Accept: application/json

### Filter categories by exact name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/categories?filter[name][eq]=Technology
Accept: application/json

### Filter categories by LIKE name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/categories?filter[name][like]=tech
Accept: application/json

### Filter categories by is_active
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/categories?filter[is_active][eq]=1
Accept: application/json

### Search categories globally
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/categories?search=science
Accept: application/json

### Sort categories descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/categories?sort=-name
Accept: application/json

### Filter tags by exact name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/tags?filter[name][eq]=php
Accept: application/json

### Filter tags by LIKE name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/tags?filter[name][like]=java
Accept: application/json

### Search tags globally
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/tags?search=framework
Accept: application/json

### Sort tags ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/tags?sort=name
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================
### 3. RELATIONSHIP FILTERING
### ============================================================

### Filter articles by category slug (exact)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[category][slug][eq]=technology
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by category name (LIKE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[category][name][like]=science
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by tag name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[tags][name][like]=php
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by tag slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[tags][slug][eq]=laravel
Accept: application/json

### Filter articles by author name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[user][name][like]=john
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================
### 4. DEEP NESTED RELATIONSHIP FILTERING
### ============================================================

### Filter articles by comment author name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[comments][user][name][like]=john
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================
### 5. COMBINED FILTERS
### ============================================================

### Filter published articles in a specific category, sorted
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[status][eq]=published&filter[category][slug][eq]=technology&sort=-view_count&per_page=5
Accept: application/json

### Search + filter + sort combination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?search=php&filter[status][eq]=published&sort=-created_at&per_page=10
Accept: application/json

### Multi-condition field filter with relation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blog/articles?filter[view_count][gte]=100&filter[view_count][lte]=5000&filter[category][name][like]=tech&sort=title
Accept: application/json
